name=GoM Extension: Guns of Tien
id=GoMExtensionGunsOfTien
description=More ammunition for Guns of Marz, all real loads of 1993: subsonic, hollow point, soft point, steel core, +P and +P+ rounds, birdshot and the AS VAL's SP-6. Adjusted gun sounds, full metal jacket rifle rounds pierce, the break-action shotguns' stocks can be sawn off to fit a holster, the Mosin-Nagant can be sawn into an Obrez, an AWC Mk9 suppressor for the MP5 and the Uzis, the MP5 family drawn to the Uzis' scale (the MP5 shown as the MP5A3), the Uzi, Mini Uzi and Micro Uzi, the Steyr AUG A1 with its integral scope and folding front grip, the Glock 21, the FN P90 with its ring sight and 5.7x28mm SS190 rounds, the M249 light machine gun, the RPK and RPK-74 with their folding bipods and the RPK's 40-round magazine and 75-round drum (both also fit Guns of Marz's AK-47), the RPD with its 100-round belt drum, Guns of Marz's Picatinny rails fitting the AUG A1, Uzi, Mini Uzi, P90 and M249; guns held like a pistol hang upright on other mods' attachment slots; belt-fed guns (the M249 and the M60) now need belt links, found or made (can be switched off). With Ammo Maker, every new round can be made. Needs Gunworks-gang and Guns of Marz. Every gun is held and reloaded with Guns of Marz's own animations, its bolt moving in the ejection port on each shot and its charging handle only when racked, as on the real guns.
